## Rules

Detailed rules live in `.claude/rules/` and load automatically based on the path being worked on.

## Workflow

- Slash commands: `/check`, `/fix-bug <description>`, `/review-rules`.
- Subagents (`.claude/agents/`): `plan` → `code` → `test` → `review`. Only `code` may edit source; at most 2 fix rounds, then report to the user.
